# Generated DocC site output under docs/.
#
# Committing it put ~30,000 files and 160 MB into this repository's history, and
# a bulk overwrite of docs/ once deleted docs/cab-backend-contract.md as
# collateral. The built site is now published from the `docs-site` branch by
# Scripts/publish-documentation.sh rather than tracked on the main line.
#
# This list mirrors `generated_entries` in Scripts/install-generated-documentation.sh,
# which still installs into docs/ for local preview and for the release pipeline.
# Keep the two lists in step. Hand-authored files in docs/ stay tracked:
# docs/cab-backend-contract.md and docs/releases/.
/docs/.nojekyll
/docs/css/
/docs/data/
/docs/developer-og-twitter.jpg
/docs/developer-og.jpg
/docs/documentation/
/docs/downloads/
/docs/favicon.ico
/docs/favicon.svg
/docs/images/
/docs/img/
/docs/index/
/docs/index.html
/docs/js/
/docs/metadata.json
/docs/theme-settings.json
/docs/videos/
